Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Black,Credits,0,0,0,,{\pos(1030,904)}Tradução: Vacalos e Mangas\NLegendas: Vacalos e Mangas / KevinVG207\N-Proibida a distribuição das legendas junto ao vídeo-\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:42.98,Black,,0,0,0,,{\fnNiagara Engraved\fs90\pos(228,940)}{\pos(236,940)}NO ÚLTIMO EPISÓDIO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:42.98,Black,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\blur3\an2\3c&H992B12&\fscx100\fscy100\p1\pos(0,828.8)\t(3355,3522,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}m 0 110 l 450 110 450 115 b 450 115 10 115 0 115
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:04.07,Black,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}A tragédia estava apenas começando...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:10.78,Black,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Um aviso misterioso que apareceu repentinamente no amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.60,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ela sumiu! Ela sumiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:19.96,Black,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uma tiara desaparecida, e o aparecimento de quatro detetives...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.04,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,{\an8}Vocês quatro são—!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:23.85,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tokai Teio. Sou uma detetive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.71,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,{\an8}Este caso ainda \Nnão começou por completo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:29.26,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,{\an8}Realmente é interessante...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:32.76,Black,Matikanefukukitaru,0,0,0,,{\an8\t(3055,3222,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Ueh... Uma sorte terrível nos espera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:39.44,Black,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8\t(3969,4136,1,\c&H000000&)}Enfim, elas se aproximaram na verdade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:41.19,Black,Detectives,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\an8\t(-18,108,1,\c&HFFFFFF&)}A culpada...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:42.98,Black,Detectives,0,0,0,,{\an8\t(1561,1811,1,\3c&HFEFEFE&)}É você!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.65,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,O qu-?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:52.43,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,Oh? Me diga o porquê.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:54.59,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,É realmente fantástico.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:57.46,Black,Matikanefukukitaru,0,0,0,,Ehh, é bem assustador...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:59.29,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Parem de brincar com isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:04.70,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Veja bem... a única pessoa que poderia escrever\Nessas letras complicadas é a McQueen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.70,0:01:06.25,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,Que decepção.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:10.22,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,Não deveríamos estar suspeitas sobre você, que esteve\Nassistindo um monte de séries de suspente ultimamente?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.53,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,O-o que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:17.58,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,Eu sinto que pude encontrar a resposta desta charada...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.43,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,...ou talvez não!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:21.81,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,O que há de errado com você?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:27.68,Black,Matikanefukukitaru,0,0,0,,Uehh... esta bola de cristal indica a McQueen como culpada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.62,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,Uma teoria interessante. Por favor se explique.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.74,Black,Matikanefukukitaru,0,0,0,,Umm.. é isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.20,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,"Pela corrente azul turva"...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.96,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Já sei! Nossa culpada é essa bola de cristal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:41.16,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,M-mas como?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.44,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Psicografia?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:44.17,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,É óbvio que não é isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:47.55,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,O que foi desta vez?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:51.76,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,Não existe mistério neste mundo que a ciência não possa resolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:53.09,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,Cheque-mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:02:00.89,Black,Proprietess,0,0,0,,Olha, eu te disse que as clientes ficariam assustadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:05.94,Black,Proprietess,0,0,0,,Só precisa colocar "Aproveite o Onsen". Não precisa escrever umas\Ncharadas só por causa da cor da água do nosso Onsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.94,0:02:07.48,Black,Owner,0,0,0,,É, você tem razão.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:10.94,Black,Proprietess,0,0,0,,Perdão, nós já vamos sair depois de tirar isto daqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:16.78,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Às vezes, existem duas verdades!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:18.46,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,Bom, hora do café da manhã.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:20.08,Black,Agnes Tachyon,0,0,0,,Bem lógico.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.96,Black,Matikanefukukitaru,0,0,0,,Que fome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:26.04,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,E-ei! E a minha tiara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:28.79,Black,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\t(1621,1955,1,\c&H000000&)}Estava no vestiário.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.77,Black,,0,0,0,,
